  "prefLabel": "Emp 404.08 Acceptable Use of Grant Funds",
  "priorExpiration": "2020-06-23",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Emp 404.08 Acceptable Use of Grant Funds. WorkInvestNH grant funds shall be used for training programs including:\n\n(a) Structured, on-site laboratory or classroom training;\n\n(b) Basic skills;\n\n(c) Technical skills;\n\n(d) Quality improvement;\n\n(e) Safety;\n\n(f) Management and supervision;\n\n(g) English as a second language; and\n\n(h) Other training programs that enhance the state’s workforce development.\n\nSource. #7765, eff 9-27-02; ss by #8989, eff 9-22-07, EXPIRES: 3-20-08 (from Emp 404.09); ss by #9092, eff 2-23-08, EXPIRED: 2-23-16\n\nNew. #12960, INTERIM, eff 12-26-19, EXPIRED: 6-23-20\n\nNew. #13074, eff 7-22-20",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/emp100-500.html"
